2:[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why NEET Preparation Needs a Smarter Approach"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"NEET (National Eligibility cum Entrance Test) is one of the most competitive exams in India, with over 20 lakh aspirants competing for approximately 1 lakh MBBS seats. The syllabus covers Physics, Chemistry, and Biology from Classes 11 and 12 — that's over 90 chapters across three subjects."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"The challenge isn't intelligence. It's planning."}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Most NEET droppers don't fail because they can't understand the concepts. They fail because they didn't allocate their time properly — spending too much on strong subjects, ignoring weak chapters, or revising too late."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["AI planning tools like PlanBot solve this by creating ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"data-driven, personalized study schedules"}]," that adapt to your specific situation."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"The 12-Month NEET 2027 Master Plan"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 1: Foundation (Months 1-4: May - August 2026)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Objective:"}]," Complete NCERT thoroughly + build concept clarity"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study Target:"}]," 6-8 hours"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Subject Split:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Physics: 2 hours/day"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Chemistry: 2 hours/day (1hr Physical + 1hr Organic/Inorganic alternating)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Biology: 2-3 hours/day"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Key Actions:"}]}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Read NCERT line by line — this is non-negotiable for NEET"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Make short notes for each chapter"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Solve NCERT exercises and exemplar problems"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Watch concept videos for difficult topics"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How PlanBot Helps:"}]," Tell PlanBot ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"I'm preparing for NEET 2027, starting fresh. I can study 7 hours daily. I'm weak in Physics and Organic Chemistry.\""}]," The AI creates a daily schedule that front-loads weak subjects during peak energy hours."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 2: Strengthening (Months 5-8: September - December 2026)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Objective:"}]," Complete reference books + topic tests"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study Target:"}]," 8-10 hours"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Subject-Wise Strategy:"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Physics:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"DC Pandey or HC Verma for problem-solving"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Focus on: Mechanics, Optics, Modern Physics, Electrostatics"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Daily: 20 numerical problems minimum"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Chemistry:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Physical: N. Avasthi problems"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Organic: MS Chauhan for reaction mechanisms"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Inorganic: NCERT + VK Jaiswal for assertion-reason"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Memorize: Periodic table trends, name reactions, reagent charts"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Biology:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Biology is 50% of the NEET paper (360 marks)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Focus on NCERT: Genetics, Ecology, Human Physiology, Plant Physiology"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Use diagrams — NEET loves diagram-based questions"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Minimum: 3 chapters revision per week"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How PlanBot Helps:"}]," The AI schedules your study blocks with proper breaks (Pomodoro-style), inserts revision slots for previously completed chapters, and ensures all three subjects get proportional attention."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 3: Revision & Mock Tests (Months 9-12: January - April 2027)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Objective:"}]," Revise everything + take 50+ mock tests"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study Target:"}]," 10-12 hours"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Weekly Structure:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Monday-Friday: Revision + chapter tests"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Saturday: Full mock test (180 questions, 200 minutes)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Sunday: Mock test analysis + weak area revision"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mock Test Strategy:"}]}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Start with subject-wise mocks (Physics only, Chemistry only, Biology only)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Move to full-length mocks by month 10"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Analyze every mock: note wrong answers, revision gaps, time management issues"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Target: Minimum 50 full-length mocks before NEET 2027"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How PlanBot Helps:"}]," PlanBot's weekly AI reports (Elite/God tier) analyze your mock test patterns, identify trending weak chapters, and adjust your revision priority accordingly. It's like having a personal NEET mentor reviewing your data every week."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Subject-Wise Chapter Priority"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Biology (50% of NEET — Most Important)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"High-Yield Chapters (study first):"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Human Physiology (Digestion, Circulation, Respiration, Excretion, Neural)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Genetics & Evolution (Molecular basis, Mendelian, Evolution)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Ecology & Environment (Organisms, Ecosystem, Biodiversity)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Cell Biology (Cell cycle, Biomolecules)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Plant Physiology (Photosynthesis, Respiration, Growth)"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Medium-Yield:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Reproduction (Human + Plant)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Biotechnology (Principles + Applications)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Animal Kingdom classification"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Physics (25% of NEET)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"High-Yield:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Mechanics (Newton's Laws, Work-Energy, Rotational Motion)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Electrostatics & Current Electricity"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Optics (Ray + Wave)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Modern Physics (Photoelectric, Atomic Models, Nuclear)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Thermodynamics"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Medium-Yield:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Waves & Oscillations"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Electromagnetic Induction"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Semiconductor Devices"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Chemistry (25% of NEET)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Physical Chemistry:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Thermodynamics & Thermochemistry"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Chemical Equilibrium"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Electrochemistry"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Chemical Kinetics"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Solutions"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Organic Chemistry:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"GOC (General Organic Chemistry)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Hydrocarbons"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Alcohols, Phenols, Ethers"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Aldehydes, Ketones, Carboxylic Acids"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Amines, Biomolecules, Polymers"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Inorganic Chemistry:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Chemical Bonding"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Coordination Compounds"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"p-Block Elements"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"d & f Block Elements"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Periodic Properties"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Common Mistakes NEET Aspirants Make"}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Ignoring NCERT"}]," — NEET is 95% NCERT-based. Don't prioritize coaching modules over NCERT."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Starting mock tests too late"}]," — Begin subject-wise mocks from month 6, not month 11."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Unequal subject allocation"}]," — Biology is 50% of the paper but many students give it only 30% of study time."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Not tracking progress"}]," — Without data on what you've covered, you'll keep revising the same topics."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Studying without a schedule"}]," — Random studying leads to random results. Use AI planning."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to Use PlanBot for NEET Preparation"}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Download PlanBot"}]," from Google Play Store"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Select Student persona"}]," during setup"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Tell the AI:"}]," ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"I'm preparing for NEET 2027. I have 12 months. I can study 8 hours daily. My weak areas are Physics numericals and Organic Chemistry reactions. I follow NCERT + DC Pandey + MS Chauhan.\""}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Get your daily plan"}]," — AI-generated study schedule with subject rotation, break optimization, and revision slots"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Build your streak"}]," — Use the streak system to maintain daily consistency"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Review weekly reports"}]," — Elite/God tier users get AI performance analysis every Monday"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Can PlanBot create a complete NEET study plan?"}],"\nA: Yes. PlanBot's AI generates personalized daily study schedules for NEET aspirants. It considers your timeline, daily study hours, weak subjects, and reference books to create an optimized plan."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: How many hours should I study daily for NEET?"}],"\nA: For a 12-month preparation: 6-8 hours in the foundation phase, 8-10 during strengthening, and 10-12 during the revision phase. Quality matters more than quantity — use PlanBot to optimize your study blocks."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Is PlanBot free for NEET students?"}],"\nA: Yes. PlanBot's Free tier gives 2 AI plans/day. For serious NEET preparation, we recommend Pro (₹99/mo) or God tier (₹249/mo with weekly AI reports)."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Which AI tier is best for NEET planning?"}],"\nA: PlanBot's God tier uses our most powerful AI, which provides the most detailed and personalized study plans. However, even the Free tier creates excellent NEET study schedules."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Can PlanBot help with NEET revision scheduling?"}],"\nA: Absolutely. Tell PlanBot which chapters you've completed, and the AI will schedule spaced revision sessions at optimal intervals to maximize retention."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","em",null,{"children":["Start your NEET 2027 journey today. ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cpm.planbot","children":"Download PlanBot free"}]," and let AI create your personalized study plan."]}]}]]
